      "spam": false,
      "value": "Hi Darkvulpine,\n\nThis result can be accomplished via the VRC_PlayerMods(https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrc_playermods) which has been broken for the last few months. Today's 0.12.0p2 patch will fix this component. Using PlayerMods, you can modify player speeds, jump height and others. \n\nWe'll likely have other solutions for this in the future, but at least we have a way to do it now!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
