      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: Well the main reason I request this is giant characters having issues with movement, feeling slow, and animations not matching, and was hoping I could have my avatar move faster to go with the size.  However that idea is neat that can be done, but it is more of an avatar aspect, not exactly a world issue.",
