      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: Partly yes, it would be nice to have just that, but also allow giants to move faster, because it feels sooo slow, but if that can't be added, I'll just have to make due with having a custom world where players can have their speeds adjusted there manually with perhaps some scripts, but if we can have walk animations go in sync, that would be great too\n\nAs it is right now, I move the joystick all the way, and my feel like I'm running place (animations too fast), I nudge my joystick, and I slide along the ground I look like a slow-mo ice skater (animations too slow)\n\nBut my original idea was to have it so players can set in their own options, or in Avatar SDK, a variable that determines that avatar's base speed",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
