      "value": "@{59b9afc4e46c3651b53cf856|full_name}: Agreed. I'd like to see something like \"scale IPD\" for the walking speed. A small avatar is slower, human size walks normal(maybe adjustable +/- x%) and giant models walk faster.\nOf course the actual walking and animation speed should match each other. And what about custom non humanoid rigs? I'd like to see my horse running much faster than humans, regardless of the world I'm in...",
